# C9D Identity — @c9d/auth-react (client SDK)

## Install

Use **`GET /api/sdk/manifest`** on the target identity host for `version`, `tarball`, `install`, and `docs`.

## Provider

All SDK components and hooks must be under **`C9DAuthProvider`** with:

- **`clientId`** — public OAuth client id for the environment
- **`identityUrl`** — origin of C9D Identity (e.g. `https://identity.c9d.engineering`), no trailing slash
- **`apiBaseUrl`** (optional, recommended) — product-local embedded bridge base (`/api/auth/embedded`)
- **`locale`** / **`messages`** (optional) — auth component translation surface

## Boundaries

- **Product UI / session:** `@c9d/auth-react` — never embed **PAT** or **`clientSecret`** in client code.
- **Product middleware / callback handlers:** `@c9d/auth-next`.
- **Admin automation:** MCP + PAT — use **`c9d-identity-mcp`** skill, not this rule.

